                        "review": "An arced-style action game with simple but satisfying gameplay and a surprisingly high level of difficulty. Even in co-op, expect to die often, but the game never feels overly repetitive and constantly makes you want to try another run. The cyberpunk atmosphere is great, with plenty of weapons and bonuses to experiment with.\n\n100% steam achievements\nTime : 123.5H\nCompletion Difficulty : 7/10\nPlaythroughs : 4+\nMissables : None\nNotable requirements : Complete the game on hard with all four characters and complete the hard block level 3 with all character, various challenges.",
